#   pad   : a round button          rect : a rounded-rectangle icon button (Select / Start, in the top row)
# The D-pad and X Y A B are not in this table: layout() makes them FINGERTIP-SIZED CIRCLES (FINGER_MM across, from the
# screen's real size) - four direction circles on the left (two at once = a diagonal; arrow keys + hat) and the four
# face buttons mirrored on the right, same size and placement, so every hit zone is obvious. The two THUMBSTICKS float: a touch in the left / right half below the
